    "boss_min": 2000,
    "note": "where the bosses' lives are: the whole table of enemies (_hps, a list). The game has no flag for its boss coming: the entry filled with the life the mission's boss starts with (boss_life, from Seb's captures: Tetsuyuki 2200, Hairbuster Riberts 3900, Tani Oh 2000, Shoe & Karn 1200 and 1500, the two tanks at once) is the boss, named after the mission; in a mission not listed, a life of boss_min or more; any other life of 200 or more is a big enemy with a quiet bar (a helicopter 400, the mission 2 machine of 1200 before its boss). boss_dead (the game's flag) ends the boss, mission_done (its end word with the boss down) shows MISSION COMPLETE"
  },
